{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u23f1\ufe0f Estimated playtime: <strong>About 1 hour</strong> for first-time players. Replay runs may be completed more quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcbe <strong>Chapter save system</strong> supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Info</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857420/extras/82b1aff7c7c44a881a75f5208b933d22.avif?t=1753117178\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The glamorous life of a K-POP idol, and the fanatical obsession and dark shadow lurking behind it. Watched by an unknown presence, who will you trust, and what will you doubt?<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857420/extras/fb5fda05c8a4a9e3db4d02433526d213.avif?t=1753117178\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After your successful debut, you begin to feel an unknown gaze in your daily life. The attention you once believed was simple fan adoration turns into madness, now approaching as a threat that seems to see right through you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Life of a K-pop Idol</strong>:<br>Experience a day in the life \u2014 fan letters, vocal training, fan sign events. But not everything goes well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore the Entertainment Agency</strong>:<br>Move freely through practice rooms, offices, staff caf\u00e9, and restrooms to uncover clues and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Psychological Horror</strong>:<br>A creeping sense of being watched builds tension through subtle detail and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Luxury Apartment with Secrets</strong>:<br>What once felt safe now seems strangely unfamiliar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Endings</strong>:<br>There are 2 different endings based on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WASD - Move<br>Shift - Run<br>E - Interact<br>ESC - Options</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3857420?t=1753117178","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3857420?t=1753117178","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857420/202d05f8481909fbde95cdd93882a5568f00526e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753117178","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857420/202d05f8481909fbde95cdd93882a5568f00526e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753117178","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains psychological horror elements involving obsessive behavior, stalking, and disturbing imagery.\r\nThere are scenes of blood, implied violence, and moments that may cause emotional discomfort."},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857420/extras/8902904f6781625410671d6d56216deb.avif?t=1753117178\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u23f1\ufe0f Estimated playtime: <strong>About 1 hour</strong> for first-time players. Replay runs may be completed more quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcbe <strong>Chapter save system</strong> supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Info</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857420/extras/82b1aff7c7c44a881a75f5208b933d22.avif?t=1753117178\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The glamorous life of a K-POP idol, and the fanatical obsession and dark shadow lurking behind it. Watched by an unknown presence, who will you trust, and what will you doubt?<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857420/extras/fb5fda05c8a4a9e3db4d02433526d213.avif?t=1753117178\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After your successful debut, you begin to feel an unknown gaze in your daily life. The attention you once believed was simple fan adoration turns into madness, now approaching as a threat that seems to see right through you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Life of a K-pop Idol</strong>:<br>Experience a day in the life \u2014 fan letters, vocal training, fan sign events. But not everything goes well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore the Entertainment Agency</strong>:<br>Move freely through practice rooms, offices, staff caf\u00e9, and restrooms to uncover clues and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Psychological Horror</strong>:<br>A creeping sense of being watched builds tension through subtle detail and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Luxury Apartment with Secrets</strong>:<br>What once felt safe now seems strangely unfamiliar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Endings</strong>:<br>There are 2 different endings based on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WASD - Move<br>Shift - Run<br>E - Interact<br>ESC - Options</p>","developers":["Jayhyeon Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857420/86542b9b869b1b1a4f619ee7ce23653028c87a00/header.jpg?t=1753117178","is_free":false,"linux_requirement